# Nexus Community Project - Environment Variables Template
# Copy this to .env.local and fill in your values

# ====================================
# AI API Keys (Optional - for AI Helper)
# ====================================
# Users should configure these in Settings > AI Tools instead
# These environment variables are NOT used by the app
# API keys are stored securely in browser localStorage only

# OpenAI (GPT-3.5, GPT-4)
# Get from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# REACT_APP_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Anthropic (Claude)
# Get from: https://console.anthropic.com
# REACT_APP_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Google (Gemini)
# Get from: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
# REACT_APP_GOOGLE_API_KEY=AIza...

# ====================================
# Notes
# ====================================
# - API keys entered in the Settings page take precedence
# - Keys are stored locally in your browser only
# - No server-side storage (privacy-first!)
# - Template responses work without any API keys
